\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  RBI/ \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  -2: Responding To Fin Sec Comments \b0\par\par\uc2  By Raghavendra Upadhyaya \par \uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 1998\par 14:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOMBAY (Dow Jones)--There is no cap on the amount of reserves the Reserve Bank of India can use for its forward market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but it does ensure reserves are used wisely, a senior official at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  told Dow Jones Friday. \par \par \uc2  'There is no cap on the RBI's forward \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' either set by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  or the government, the official who did not wish to be named said. \par \par \uc2  But 'as a prudential norm the RBI keeps a close watch' on its forward \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he said and added that 'sometimes they are less than 10% (of the total reserves) and sometimes more than 10%'. \par \par \uc2  India's Finance Secretary Montek Singh Ahluwalia Thursday said that the RBI's forward \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is limited to 10% of its total reserves, which currently stand at around $27 billion. \par \par \uc2  'At times of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis this 10% could go up to 13%,' he told journalists Thursday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves stood at $27.74 billion in the week ended Feb. 6. The latest data for the month ended December shows the RBI has an outstanding net forward sales position of $1.96 billion. \par \par \uc2  But the RBI also regularly buys and sells its forward positions via swap \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Ahluwalia said this is in reference to the Asia \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis and in contrast to the situation in Thailand where virtually 90% of the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves was used up in forward market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Ahluwalia's statement triggered speculation that the government has\par set a cap on the RBI's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par - Raghavendra Upadhyaya 91-22-2884211; rupadhyay@ap.org\par -0-\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 20-02-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1310GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du2k01jy1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
