\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2 /RBI  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  -2: Bought Dlrs For Feb Delivery \b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Februar 1998\par 10:49\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOMBAY (Dow Jones)--The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to do swap trades at about 0815 GMT (3:15 a.m. EST) Tuesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The bank sold spot dollars and bought them for February delivery, paying premiums around 0.14 rupee(INR), they added. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't purchase dollars for other maturities, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  RBI has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the forward market through sell-buy swaps to keep premiums high. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fears if premiums become attractive importers may rush in to buy forward dollars and indirectly push down spot rupee. \par \par \uc2  With interbank call rates falling as a result of ample rupee-supplies in the past three or four trading days, forward premiums have been falling. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday the premiums on February dollars were fairly low at INR0.13-.18, or 9%, compared with their Monday opening levels of INR0.26-.31 (16.8%). Following the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's action, the premiums have risen marginally to INR0.16-0.18. \par \par \uc2  However, premiums for delivery beyond March have moved only downward Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The spot rupee is at INR38.7450-.7550 to the U.S. dollar at 0930 GMT (4:30 a.m. EST), up from its Monday close of INR38.75-.77. \par \par \uc2  For the latest indicative rupee rates, please see Dow Jones page [26501]. \par \par \uc2  -By Latha Venkatesh; 91-22-2884211; lvenkatesh@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 10-02-98 \par \par \uc2  0949GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du2a013ow\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
