\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2 /Reserve Bk/ \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  -2: Buys Feb, April, May Dlrs \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Februar 1998\par 07:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOMBAY  (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market through swap deals between 0530 and 0545 GMT (12:30 and 1 a.m. EST) Monday, dealers at several foreign banks said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold spot dollars and bought February, April and May dollars, they said. The premiums the RBI paid were around the market premiums, they added. \par \par \uc2  At 0600 GMT (1 a.m. EST) the premiums on February dollars were 0.18-0.22 rupee (INR), for April they were INR 1.50-.55 and for May INR1.90-.95. \par \par \uc2  The swaps are intended to prop up the spot rupee, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The RBI has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  through sell-buy swaps since last week as it has been worried about the sharp fall in forward premiums since their levels at the end of January, sources say. \par \par \uc2  Dealers explained that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  probably feared if forward premiums fall rapidly, importers may rush in to cover forward dollaros and indirectly put pressure on the spot rupee, making the entire outlook on the rupee bearish. \par \par \uc2  The spot rupee was quoted at INR38.73-38.75 at 0610 GMT (1:10 a.m. EST), up from its Friday close of INR38.70-38.73. \par \par \uc2  For the latest indicative rupee rates, please see Dow Jones page [26501]. \par \par \uc2  -By Latha Venkatesh; 91-22-2884211; lvenkatesh@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 09-02-98 \par \par \uc2  0623GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du29012yn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
