\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  -2: Spot Dollar Up \b0\par\par\uc2 204 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Februar 1998\par 07:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones Asian Equities Report \par \uc2 AER\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOMBAY (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Reserve Bank of India interevened in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market through swap deals around 0530 GMT Thursday, a dealer at two foreign banks said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold spot dollars and bought April and May dollars, they said. 'RBI paid a premium of 2.00 rupees (INR) for April,' one dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The swaps are intended to prop up the spot rupee, dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The RBI has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  through sell-buy swaps since Tuesday as it has been worried about the sharp fall in forward premiums since their last week levels, sources say. \par \par \uc2  Dealers explained that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  probably feared that given the tumbling forward premiums, importers may rush into cover forward and indirectly put pressure on the spot rupee, making the entire outlook on the rupee bearish. \par \par \uc2  The spot rupee was quoted at INR38.77-38.79 at 0610 GMT (1:10 a.m. EST) up from its Wednesday close of INR38.71-38.74. \par \par \uc2  For the latest indicative rupee rates, please see Dow Jones page [26501]. \par \par \uc2  By Latha Venkatesh; 91-22-2884211; lvenkatesh@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires  05-02-98 \par \par \uc2  0621GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020010914du250097j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
