\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  RBI  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  in forward market. \b0\par\par\uc2 187 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Januar 1998\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOMBAY, Jan 27 (Reuters) - The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market through swap deals in afternoon trade on Tuesday to check a rise in forward dollar premiums, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "They (RBI) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in August-delivery dollars," said a dealer at a Bombay bank. \par \par \uc2  August-delivery dollars were quoted at a premium of 4.03/4.33 rupees after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  against opening quotes of 4.10/4.30. \par \par \uc2  No details on the amount of the RBI's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  were available but dealers said it was "not aggressive". \par \par \uc2  "They (RBI) are not very aggressive," said a dealer. "Premiums have dropped a bit but demand remains strong and supply poor." \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the rupee was stronger from its previous close against the dollar in spot deals on sales from exporters. \par \par \uc2  At 1301 local time (0731 GMT), the rupee was quoted 38.442/462 per dollar against its previous close of 38.70/73. \par \par \uc2  ((Bombay newsroom, +91 22 265-9000 fax +91 22 264-1699, Bombay.newsroom@reuters.com)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1998 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du1r015xd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
