\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  Rupee Premiums On Forward Dlrs Up; \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Awaited \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Januar 1998\par 07:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOMBAY (Dow Jones)--Indian rupee premiums for forward dollars are up Monday with no sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the forward market by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Reserve Bank of India, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The premium for July-dollars is trading Monday at between 2.25 rupees (INR) and INR2.35. It had closed Friday at INR2.25-INR2.40. \par \par \uc2  The premium opened slightly lower Monday on market talk that the RBI would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling forward dollars. \par \par \uc2  The RBI had been selling forward dollars almost every session over the last three weeks to prevent forward premiums from rising. \par \par \uc2  According to the latest data available, the RBI had outstanding net forward sales of $1.396 billion at the end of November 1997. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the RBI is expected to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the swaps market again later Monday, buying spot dollars and selling forward dollars. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the dollar is up against the rupee in the spot market. \par \par \uc2  At 0600 GMT (1:00 am EST), the dollar is trading at INR39.810-INR39.825 in a thin market, up from between INR39.71-INR39.76 at the close of trading Friday. \par \par \uc2  The dollar opened lower Monday at INR39.73-INR39.78, then rose to trade at INR39.85. However, it fell back after the State Bank of India, a large commercial bank, sold the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  For the latest indicative rupee rates, please see Dow Jones page [26501]. \par \par \uc2  -By Pankaj Aher; (91-22) 288-4211; paher@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 12-01-98 \par \par \uc2  0633GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 1847 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du1c0081e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
