\par\par \b \uc2  India rupee quiet, unmoved by political turmoil. \b0\par\par\uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 November 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOMBAY, Nov 20 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee was trading quiet at 37.39/41 per dollar in afternoon trade Thursday, little affected by political developments, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  They said \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market players were looking for direction more from the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI), which \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  actively in the morning, than from the emerging political scenario. \par \par \uc2  "With the RBI looming large today, no major flare-up is likely," said a dealer at a private bank. \par \par \uc2  "I think corporates are waiting to see what really happens," said a dealer at a foreign bank. "Some people are talking of a compromise and the stock market has rallied on this hope." \par \par \uc2  "As far as we \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market players are concerned, I think it is RBI who will move the market and they have given a clear indication in the morning that they want the rupee to stay around current levels," he added. \par \par \uc2  Analysts had predicted turmoil for markets after the Congress party decided to ask the ruling coalition to expel one of its members. Congress is not part of the minority 15-party United Front coalition but supports it from outside. \par \par \uc2  The rupee opened steady at 37.46/49 and weakened to 37.49 before rallying on RBI dollar sales. While no precise figures of the quantum of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  are available, dealers estimated it could be around $100 million. \par \par \uc2  -- Bombay Newsroom (91) 22-265 9000; Fax (91) 22-264 1699 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: bombay.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtbk029sa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
