\par\par \b \uc2  India Rupee Slips To New 21-Mo Low, Trades At 36.95 To Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 325 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 November 1997\par 04:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BOMBAY (AP-Dow Jones)--The Indian rupee opened at a new 21-month low against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday amid expectations that the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  aggressively to temporarily halt the slide of the Indian unit, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar opened Tuesday between 36.91-.94 rupees, up from its close between 36.88-.89 rupees Monday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been traded at a high of 36.95 rupees Tuesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  But dealers said the Reserve Bank of India hasn't been seen in the market yet Tuesday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't even inquired on prices, as it generally does when the market turns volatile, a dealer at a foreign bank said. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was last traded above 36.90 rupees on Feb. 13, 1996. It was also traded above 37.00 rupees the same month and it traded at a record high of 38.40 rupees in intraday trading on Feb. 6 1996. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been traded at successive new 20-month highs in the previous three sessions. The dollar rose above 36.30 rupees on Oct. 29 and has been rising continuously after that. \par \par \uc2  That rise has been fueled by the increasing belief that the RBI wants the rupee to depreciate slowly in order to lessen the impact of Southeast Asian devaluations on Indian exports. \par \par \uc2  On Monday, the Reserve Bank of India is estimated to have sold between $100 million and $150 million in outright forward contracts and swaps for six months forward, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  That \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was over and above its sales of $360 million Wednesday and another $200 million Tuesday last. \par \par \uc2  For the latest rupee indicative rates, please see Dow Jones Markets page [17960]. \par \par \uc2  -By Pankaj Aher; 91-22-2884211; paher@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 18-11-97 \par \par \uc2  0351GMT \par \par \uc2  1164 1847 62506 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtbi08qzp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
